  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "The version 2.0.2 of myDATA is embedded into the library. Specifically, the following changes have been done.\n\tA. Class SendInvoices\n\t\t- Elements Structure\n\t\t\t1. The field receivingNotePurpose has been added.\n\t\t\t2. The field otherReceivingNotePurposeTitle has been added.\n\t\t\t3. The field nonObligatedRecipient has been added.\n\t\t\t4. The field withoutDigitalTransportTracking has been added.\n\tB. Class DeliveryNote\n\t\t- TransportDetails Structure\n\t\t\tThe field packingsList has been added.\n\t\t- The method ConfirmDeliveryReturn has been added.\n\tC. myDATATools\n\t\t- The method getReceivingNotePurpose has been added.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
